    "One contiguous run 0x02017e60..0x02018aa4, gapless in config/arm9/delinks.txt between SharedFilePtr and func_02018aa4: the loaded-overlay slots, the LZ-tagged file loaders, and the thirteen-NARC archive table machinery.",
    "The run shares one bss block 0x0209d3b0..0x0209d454: the asset-handle table count/table, the ROM archive a path last resolved in, the last file id any load touched, the myFS_ReadFile scratch word, and the 12 loaded-overlay slots, ending exactly at Display's bss.",
