    "func_02018598's return-slot struct copy is the one place mwccarm keeps a fieldwise copy it otherwise optimizes away; the by-value return spelling pins it, and all 33 functions match from the single merged compile.",
    "mwccarm emits deferred bodies in reverse source order, so the asset-handle table allocator is first in source and the overlay-slot reset last."
